    "Your enrolled faces couldn't be read, so nothing was saved — writing now would overwrite them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取已录入的人脸，因此未保存任何内容——现在写入会覆盖原有数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your password is required to unlock your Mac. It is encrypted and securely stored on your device. Glance works entirely offline, so your password never leaves your Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你的密码才能解锁 Mac。密码会加密并安全存储在这台设备上。Glance 完全离线运行，密码不会离开你的 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
